1
00:00:44,460 --> 00:00:45,310
[Unsoiled Starlight]

2
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:46,720
[Episode 14]

3
00:00:46,750 --> 00:00:47,330
[Adapted from Migu's novel
“Unsoiled Starlight” ]

4
00:00:47,350 --> 00:00:47,960
[Original Writer: Shan Gu Jun]

5
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:49,820
[Shengpurui Company Program]

6
00:00:50,160 --> 00:00:52,280
You'd better give me
a reasonable explanation

7
00:00:52,280 --> 00:00:53,740
before the thing blows up.

8
00:00:57,650 --> 00:00:58,820
[Zhuoyuan Technology]

9
00:00:57,940 --> 00:00:58,880
For what?

10
00:00:59,480 --> 00:01:01,240
Why did you throw away
the important document?

11
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:03,040
It disrupts the company's workflow.

12
00:01:03,040 --> 00:01:05,200
This isn't just an internal matter
for our law firm.

13
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:06,480
It directly affects

14
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:07,680
how we coordinate with clients.

15
00:01:07,680 --> 00:01:09,940
What do you stand to gain from doing this?

16
00:01:11,240 --> 00:01:12,039
Shu Tinglan,

17
00:01:12,560 --> 00:01:14,120
why are you slandering me?

18
00:01:15,520 --> 00:01:17,000
Everyone knows that

19
00:01:16,460 --> 00:01:19,010
[Zhuoyuan Technology]

20
00:01:17,080 --> 00:01:19,160
you're the primary contact
for this project.

21
00:01:19,160 --> 00:01:20,320
The content and quantity of the document

22
00:01:20,320 --> 00:01:22,250
were all signed and checked by you.

23
00:01:22,410 --> 00:01:23,240
As for why they are lost,

24
00:01:23,240 --> 00:01:24,900
Isn't that a question for you?

25
00:01:25,360 --> 00:01:26,330
So you mean

26
00:01:26,720 --> 00:01:28,120
I threw away the document

27
00:01:28,120 --> 00:01:29,400
to hinder my own work,

28
00:01:29,520 --> 00:01:29,920
right?

29
00:01:30,280 --> 00:01:31,240
I don't know

30
00:01:31,240 --> 00:01:32,960
if you have any other plans.

31
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:34,640
Anyway, when we

32
00:01:34,640 --> 00:01:36,400
came out of Shengpurui,

33
00:01:36,840 --> 00:01:40,039
I saw you standing
in front of the trash can for a long time.

34
00:01:40,160 --> 00:01:42,160
Maybe you threw it away by yourself.

35
00:01:45,080 --> 00:01:45,920
Jiajia.

36
00:01:46,680 --> 00:01:48,240
I never said

37
00:01:48,520 --> 00:01:50,440
where the document was found.

38
00:01:51,280 --> 00:01:53,280
How do you know it was not
in the trash can at Zhuoyuan Technology

39
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:54,640
but Shengpurui?

40
00:01:55,360 --> 00:01:56,600
I saw you at Shengpurui,

41
00:01:56,600 --> 00:01:58,640
so it must be the trash can there.

42
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:03,560
This is the surveillance video
from that time.

43
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:05,120
Do I need to play it
during the report later

44
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:06,920
in front of Mr. Zhuo?

45
00:02:11,070 --> 00:02:12,720
Whatever you say goes.

46
00:02:12,880 --> 00:02:14,560
After all, you can rely on
the favor of an old classmate

47
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:16,240
to gain favor with Mr. Zhuo.

48
00:02:16,640 --> 00:02:19,040
Who's to say
you don't have a thing for Mr. Zhuo?

49
00:02:19,040 --> 00:02:19,840
Stop arguing!

50
00:02:22,310 --> 00:02:25,740
[Zhuoyuan Technology]

51
00:02:31,760 --> 00:02:32,640
First of all,

52
00:02:33,760 --> 00:02:34,840
moving the project forward

53
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:36,520
isn't mine to decide alone.

54
00:02:37,480 --> 00:02:38,640
Standardized procedures

55
00:02:38,640 --> 00:02:39,700
and collaboration

56
00:02:39,960 --> 00:02:41,520
are our company's
most important principles.

57
00:02:40,720 --> 00:02:42,230
[Zhuoyuan Technology]

58
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:44,079
Secondly,

59
00:02:44,650 --> 00:02:46,480
as to why the file was lost,

60
00:02:46,720 --> 00:02:48,320
I am the most direct witness.

61
00:03:18,640 --> 00:03:19,040
Okay.

62
00:03:19,600 --> 00:03:21,260
Send the project report to me.

63
00:03:24,120 --> 00:03:25,120
What Lawyer Shu

64
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:26,400
said is true.

65
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:28,200
Lawyer Xiao,

66
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:30,930
please handle this matter seriously.

67
00:03:31,329 --> 00:03:34,150
[Zhuoyuan Technology]

68
00:03:31,640 --> 00:03:32,680
Finally,

69
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:34,530
I want to clarify one thing.

70
00:03:34,640 --> 00:03:37,040
Lawyer Shu
has no personal feelings for me.

71
00:03:37,079 --> 00:03:38,200
On the contrary,

72
00:03:40,320 --> 00:03:41,920
i'm trying to pursue her.

73
00:03:46,390 --> 00:03:48,750
[Zhuoyuan Technology]

74
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:52,540
I hope everyone will stop

75
00:03:52,540 --> 00:03:54,270
spreading irrelevant rumors.

76
00:03:56,840 --> 00:04:00,390
[Zhuoyuan Technology]

77
00:04:21,209 --> 00:04:22,410
You changed the lock.

78
00:04:22,880 --> 00:04:24,480
It's our company's product.

79
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:26,840
Zhuo Yu'an,

80
00:04:27,440 --> 00:04:29,170
I really don't understand you.

81
00:04:29,200 --> 00:04:31,000
Did I not make myself clear?

82
00:04:31,480 --> 00:04:32,240
I don't want us to have

83
00:04:32,240 --> 00:04:34,640
any ties other than work.

84
00:04:35,960 --> 00:04:38,620
But you said those things
in public again today.

85
00:04:38,850 --> 00:04:40,510
I really don't know what to do.

86
00:04:42,260 --> 00:04:43,120
I'm sorry.

87
00:04:44,040 --> 00:04:45,640
I wasn't thoughtful enough.

88
00:04:47,240 --> 00:04:49,490
I don't want to hear those words anymore.

89
00:04:49,490 --> 00:04:51,360
You want to cut ties with me.

90
00:04:51,520 --> 00:04:52,200
Fine.

91
00:04:54,280 --> 00:04:55,320
But at least give me a chance

92
00:04:55,320 --> 00:04:57,040
to explain myself, okay?

93
00:04:58,960 --> 00:04:59,600
Okay.

94
00:04:59,820 --> 00:05:00,400
Go ahead.

95
00:05:05,880 --> 00:05:07,210
Can we talk while we eat?

96
00:05:14,440 --> 00:05:15,570
All the dishes today

97
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:17,360
are made to your taste.

98
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:20,000
If you have something to say,

99
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:21,120
just say it.

100
00:05:30,440 --> 00:05:31,480
Tinglan.

101
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:34,800
The way things are between us now...

102
00:05:36,159 --> 00:05:37,159
it's all my fault.

103
00:05:37,880 --> 00:05:39,880
I never formally told you how I felt.

104
00:05:43,680 --> 00:05:44,680
Not recently

105
00:05:47,330 --> 00:05:48,200
but

106
00:05:49,560 --> 00:05:50,760
since high school.

107
00:05:53,840 --> 00:05:56,300
The day of our high school
graduation party,

108
00:05:58,280 --> 00:05:59,880
I was sitting across from you.

109
00:05:59,880 --> 00:06:01,380
Happy graduation!

110
00:06:00,890 --> 00:06:05,280
[High school graduation party]

111
00:06:09,320 --> 00:06:11,520
There were many classmates between us.

112
00:06:19,200 --> 00:06:20,080
So I just wanted

113
00:06:20,930 --> 00:06:22,120
to walk to your side

114
00:06:22,360 --> 00:06:23,520
step by step.

115
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:28,840
Yu'an,

116
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:30,120
don't just sit there.

117
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:31,120
Come sing a song.

118
00:06:31,830 --> 00:06:33,000
Go ahead. Go ahead.

119
00:06:33,159 --> 00:06:34,320
Okay.

120
00:06:39,670 --> 00:06:41,530
I slowly switched seats with them

121
00:06:42,040 --> 00:06:43,570
and finally sat next to you.

122
00:06:49,440 --> 00:06:50,240
But

123
00:06:53,000 --> 00:06:54,200
when I made it,

124
00:06:54,600 --> 00:06:56,000
you were already asleep.

125
00:06:57,800 --> 00:06:58,920
You slept soundly,

126
00:06:59,280 --> 00:07:00,320
leaning on me.

127
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:02,280
I was afraid of waking you up,

128
00:07:02,400 --> 00:07:04,730
so I watched you all night without moving.

129
00:07:19,760 --> 00:07:21,360
Before I knew it,

130
00:07:21,680 --> 00:07:22,720
I fell asleep too.

131
00:07:40,560 --> 00:07:41,760
When I woke up,

132
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:43,960
you had already left.

133
00:07:45,409 --> 00:07:46,120
Later,

134
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:49,060
I got your phone number from a classmate.

135
00:07:49,200 --> 00:07:51,659
I called three times,
but you didn't answer.

136
00:07:52,040 --> 00:07:53,280
The fourth time,

137
00:07:54,320 --> 00:07:55,800
you yelled at me loudly.

138
00:07:59,080 --> 00:08:01,160
Maybe I was being too persistent.

139
00:08:02,560 --> 00:08:03,360
Sorry.

140
00:08:04,840 --> 00:08:06,900
I didn't know it was your number then.

141
00:08:08,200 --> 00:08:09,400
During that time,

142
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:12,020
something happened in my family.

143
00:08:13,760 --> 00:08:14,920
Whoever called,

144
00:08:15,290 --> 00:08:16,520
I reacted the same way

145
00:08:17,520 --> 00:08:19,180
as I thought it was a spam call.

146
00:08:21,400 --> 00:08:22,480
Actually, there are some things

147
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:24,540
I should have told you in high school.

148
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:27,360
Since high school,

149
00:08:27,360 --> 00:08:30,490
when I heard you play
that piano piece at the orientation

150
00:08:30,960 --> 00:08:32,620
and when you held the workbook

151
00:08:33,520 --> 00:08:35,250
and called me by the wrong name,

152
00:08:36,200 --> 00:08:37,240
up until now,

153
00:08:39,039 --> 00:08:41,840
it might have all been
my one-sided entanglement.

154
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:47,000
I still owe you a formal confession.

155
00:08:48,800 --> 00:08:49,600
Shu Tinglan,

156
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:53,120
I truly admire you

157
00:08:54,280 --> 00:08:55,320
and like you.

158
00:08:57,760 --> 00:08:59,000
Could you consider

159
00:09:02,320 --> 00:09:03,560
giving me a chance?

160
00:09:16,520 --> 00:09:17,320
Zhuo Yu'an.

161
00:09:18,380 --> 00:09:19,440
To be honest,

162
00:09:20,800 --> 00:09:22,130
I have feelings for you.

163
00:09:23,080 --> 00:09:24,160
Maybe even

164
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:26,120
more than just feelings.

165
00:09:27,560 --> 00:09:29,420
I've also thought very seriously

166
00:09:32,760 --> 00:09:33,960
about whether to take

167
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:35,820
our relationship a step further.

168
00:09:36,610 --> 00:09:37,720
But the reality is,

169
00:09:38,200 --> 00:09:39,240
there's a problem

170
00:09:39,260 --> 00:09:40,920
that I just can't get past.

171
00:09:42,280 --> 00:09:43,560
Is Wen Jian

172
00:09:44,960 --> 00:09:46,220
very important to you?

173
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:48,520
She and I are really just work colleagues.

174
00:09:48,520 --> 00:09:49,560
But what if my world

175
00:09:49,560 --> 00:09:50,890
just has no room for her?

176
00:09:53,120 --> 00:09:55,050
If I force you to choose between us,

177
00:09:57,680 --> 00:09:58,480
Wen Jian or me,

178
00:09:58,800 --> 00:10:00,000
who would you choose?

179
00:10:03,720 --> 00:10:04,520
Tinglan.

180
00:10:05,640 --> 00:10:06,650
Do you want me to be someone

181
00:10:06,650 --> 00:10:09,250
who mixes
personal and professional matters?

182
00:10:16,840 --> 00:10:17,880
I understand.

183
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:20,120
Please go back, Mr. Zhuo.

184
00:10:20,520 --> 00:10:21,320
Tinglan.

185
00:10:23,040 --> 00:10:24,240
Give me some time.

186
00:10:25,160 --> 00:10:26,720
I'll handle it.

187
00:10:34,190 --> 00:10:35,080
Mr. Zhuo.

188
00:10:37,620 --> 00:10:39,880
The acquisition will be completed soon.

189
00:10:40,360 --> 00:10:41,040
After that,

190
00:10:42,190 --> 00:10:45,120
I don't want to
work on-site at Zhuoyuan Technology.

191
00:11:12,830 --> 00:11:16,100
♪ The wind blew you and me apart ♪

192
00:11:16,310 --> 00:11:20,110
♪ We once ran, cried,
and laughed together ♪

193
00:11:20,180 --> 00:11:23,580
♪ Walked all the way through
every twist and turn ♪

194
00:11:23,710 --> 00:11:27,400
♪ Yet still missed each other
just as happiness drew near ♪

195
00:11:27,490 --> 00:11:29,020
♪ Only after knowing what it is to lose ♪

196
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:30,890
♪ And never being able to touch again ♪

197
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:34,870
♪ Can we truly understand
what it means to have ♪

198
00:11:34,990 --> 00:11:36,930
♪ We loved ♪

199
00:11:37,570 --> 00:11:42,680
♪ Scattered and frozen
beneath the starry sky ♪
